   "en": "The Student Academic Success Service (SASS) supports students with a temporary or permanent disability (learning disability, ADHD, mental health condition, injury, etc.): 613-562-5777, 100 Marie-Curie Street, 4th floor, room 408. Register as early as possible in the term with documentation of the need so accommodations (extra time, separate room, notes, recording) are in place in time. SASS then communicates your accommodations to instructors without disclosing your diagnosis."
