   "en": "An account is overdue if it's still unpaid 30 days after the deadline. Until the balance is paid, you can't enrol in courses or get official documents like a transcript or your diploma. After a while, the file can be sent to a collection agency, which can hurt your credit rating. If you're struggling, contact Financial Resources at Tabaret Hall."
